                 </property>
                 <property name="text">
                  <string>&lt;html&gt;&lt;head/&gt;&lt;body&gt;&lt;p&gt;The YASA sleep scoring tool is compatible with different input files including, EDF, NATUS, and STS.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The output of the automatic scoring algorithm is a .tsv file that saves the predicted sleep stages.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;</string>
